{"type":"finding","severity":"major","fileName":"docs/work/BANDIT-101/coordination-log.jsonl","codegenInstructions":"Verify each finding against current code. Fix only still-valid issues, skip the rest with a brief reason, keep changes minimal, and validate.\n\nIn @docs/work/BANDIT-101/coordination-log.jsonl around lines 3 - 6, The coordination log entry at Sequence 6 claims Stage 4 is \"complete\" but the CodeRabbit review doc still records coderabbit_verdict: blocker and findings_status: locally_resolved_pending_refresh; reconcile by either (A) reverting or updating the coordination log Sequence 6 entry to reflect that the refresh run is pending (set state to in_progress or add an explicit pending_refresh flag and update the summary to mention the outstanding refresh run), or (B) if the refresh run was executed, update the CodeRabbit review document to set coderabbit_verdict to pass (or the correct final verdict), change findings_status to resolved, record the refresh run evidence and timestamp, and add a short note linking back to Sequence 6; ensure whichever you change includes the refresh-run evidence and a timestamp so both sources agree.","suggestions":[]}
